# Streamlit UI

## Config I/O

- Load/save prefs via `config/prefs.py` (`load_prefs`, `save_prefs`, `DEFAULT_PREFS`)
- Do not duplicate prefs paths — use `PREFS_FILE` from prefs module when adding new pages

## Charts

- **UI (browser)**: Plotly in `pages/1_📈_Live_Chart.py` / `core/chart_utils.py`
- **Daemon alerts**: mplfinance only — never Kaleido, Selenium, or headless Chrome (VPS RAM)

## UI patterns

- Reuse `Utilities/ui_components.py` for sidebar, CSS, status widgets
- Settings page writes `user_prefs.json` — daemon picks up changes within chunked sleep (≤5 min)
- Display both FTMO (Helsinki) and IST where timestamps are shown

## Do not

- Expose credentials in UI logs or session state dumps
- Auto-start the trading daemon from Streamlit without explicit user action
